# EAS Build archives from the GIT ROOT, and this repo holds five independent
# projects under one .git (backend, frontend, showcase-website, marketing, mobile)
# with NO npm workspaces. `eas build` from mobile/ was uploading the ENTIRE repo
# (~379 MB) when only mobile/ is needed.
#
# IMPORTANT: this is a DENYLIST, not an allowlist. An earlier `/*` + `!/mobile/`
# allowlist broke the build — EAS's ignore engine does NOT re-include a directory's
# CONTENTS after a broad `/*` exclude, so mobile/package.json went missing and the
# build failed with "package.json does not exist". Here mobile/ is never excluded,
# so every file it needs is uploaded; we only drop the siblings + build junk.
#
# NOTE: .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for the upload, so dependencies / build output
# are re-listed below or they'd be swept back in.

# Sibling projects — not part of the mobile build.
/backend/
/frontend/
/showcase-website/
/marketing/

# Root-level docs / infra not needed by the build.
/SchoolDeck.pdf
/SchoolDeck.pptx
/render.yaml

# Dependencies (any project) + the mobile app's build output / caches. These are
# installed / regenerated on the EAS build servers and must not be uploaded.
node_modules/
/mobile/.expo/
/mobile/dist/
/mobile/web-build/
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/android/
*.log
.DS_Store
